\title{The invariant circle}
\date{2026-11-27}

\p{The fold in \ref{fnip-0087} can lie on a closed curve. The two
equilibria on that curve can meet, and a periodic orbit can remain.}

\p{How does the period of that orbit grow as the applied current
approaches the fold?}

